---
<BaseLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogType="website" lang="zh-TW" author=" "  datePublished="2024-09-01" dateModified="2024-09-01">
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:1200px"><div class="wp-block-cover aligncenter"><img src="/images/Food-Factory1-1024x456.jpg" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1024" height="456" class="wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-299 size-large" alt="food materials processing line" style="object-position:55% 85%" title="中國馬鈴薯產品供應商" /><span aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-20 has-background-dim"></span><div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow"><h1 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size"><strong>優質馬鈴薯原料的全球製造商</strong></h1><p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><em>專業生產馬鈴薯片, 澱粉類, 麵粉, 和冷凍薯條</em></p></div></div></div></div><div style="height:66px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:100%"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><mark style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: #098b4d;" class="has-inline-color"><strong>高品質馬鈴薯片, 薯條, 澱粉製造商和供應商</strong></mark></h2></div></div><div style="height:66px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/Dinweys-potato-field.jpg" decoding="async" width="893" height="192" alt="potato materials field" class="wp-image-319" style="aspect-ratio:4.651110486364915;width:1120px;height:auto" title="中國馬鈴薯產品供應商2" /></figure></div></div></div><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-x-large-font-size" id="h-our-advantages">我們的優勢</h2><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><figure class="wp-block-table"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><tbody><tr><td><strong>地點 &amp; 原料</strong></td><td>位於河北, 中國: 位於 <strong>41° 北緯 馬鈴薯種植區</strong>, 提供了適合優質馬鈴薯種植的氣候和廣闊的地理區域. 鄰近主要優質馬鈴薯種植基地和主要出口港口.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>技術優勢</strong></td><td>馬鈴薯深加工專業知識: 由中國食品行業頂尖專家領銜，專注於馬鈴薯原料功能開發和工藝工程. 我們利用 <strong>最先進的生產線</strong> 保證產品加工質量和一致性.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>品質 &amp; 遵守</strong></td><td><strong>綜合認證:</strong> 我們擁有完整的產品資質和安全體系, 包括 <strong>ISO, 危害分析及關鍵控制點, 商業研究中心, 清真</strong>, ETC。, 確保全球監管合規性. 我們維持 <strong>優秀的生產工人和食品工程師</strong>, 支持者 <strong>完善的檢測設備和實驗室</strong> 保證產品質量穩定、優越.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>供應鏈 &amp; 容量</strong></td><td><strong>產能充足:</strong> 我們充足穩定的產能可以滿足國際大買家和採購訂單的多樣化需求.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>服務 &amp; 合夥</strong></td><td>熟練的英語溝通 &amp; 靈活的OEM: 為全球客戶提供全面支持, 包括土豆片和薯條的自有品牌定制.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>客戶認可</strong></td><td>客戶包括全球知名品牌 (百事可樂中國, 獵戶座, 大理, 統一泰國). 質量穩定、供貨及時得到證實.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div></div><div style="height:56px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-1" id="h-food-materials-product-range" style="color:#26a906;text-transform:uppercase">我們的核心馬鈴薯產品組合</h2></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>洋芋片</strong></h3><figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/Dinweys-Potato-flakes-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-1329" title="中國馬鈴薯產品供應商鈴薯澱粉" /></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">從標準品種到高檔品種, 我們的馬鈴薯片旨在滿足不同行業的需求.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">支持者 <strong>FSSC認證</strong>, 我們擁有良好的全球出口記錄.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">我們專注於 <strong>OEM解決方案</strong>, 允許我們根據您的具體要求定制規格.</p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>冷凍薯條</strong></h3><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/Dinweys-french-fries.jpg" decoding="async" width="632" height="632" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-1331" title="中國馬鈴薯產品供應商鈴薯澱粉" /></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">我們經過 ISO 認證的工廠生產高品質冷凍薯條 <strong>各種剪裁和尺寸</strong>.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">我們以靈活性為榮, 奉獻 <strong>定制 OEM 服務</strong> 完美符合您的品牌和客戶偏好.</p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>馬鈴薯澱粉</strong></h3><figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/potato-starch-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-1246" title="中國馬鈴薯產品供應商鈴薯澱粉" /></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">專為多功能性而設計, 我們的馬鈴薯澱粉是 <strong>A級產品</strong> 嚴格按照中國國家標準生產.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">其卓越的品質使其成為多個領域應用的理想選擇, 確保一致性和性能.</p></div></div><div style="height:56px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img src="/images/Dinweys-potato-field1-1024x168.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="168" alt="Food materials | raw potatoes" class="wp-image-315" style="width:1200px" title="中國馬鈴薯產品供應商" /></figure></div></div></div><p class="has-text-align-center has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph"> 請隨時聯繫我們</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>地址:</strong>&nbsp;#3, 建設北矽谷, Qiaodong District, Zhangjiakou City, 中國.</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>電話 | WhatsApp | 微信:</strong>&nbsp;+86 13323237275</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>電子郵件:&nbsp;</strong><a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a></p><p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><strong>中文站</strong>: <a href="https://www.dinweys.cn/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">丁威網</a></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>`} />
  </article>
